rcepts the $x$-axis at $x=-2.$\n\n![](images/a7/a75e8a0ae40c5cc940f9fe2d9194b0dcb5c6db2742e87a6d903dc15c0b970e99.png)\n\nWhen shown on a graph, the roots of a function are also called the $\\boldsymbol x$**-intercepts.**" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186130482 #edb/ref 1065 8802 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186130482 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "37a5be36-f2b1-5ebb-91b6-98ccbc9babaa" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186130482 #edb/ref 1067 "Introduction" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186135928 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186135929 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186135928 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186135930 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186135928 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186135931 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186135928 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186135932 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186135928 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186135933 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186135928 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186135928 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186135928 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "374553a7-81ee-5a81-93c7-e95f618cabbd" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186135929 #edb/ref 1080 "5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186135929 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186135929 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "c338da01-40d0-533e-b821-77604def14ad" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186135930 #edb/ref 1080 "6" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186135930 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186135930 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "db1d49dd-bc18-5fe3-91a1-3431242f9048" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186135931 #edb/ref 1080 "3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186135931 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186135931 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "e830039a-2929-5789-8fe0-f754442da840" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186135932 #edb/ref 1080 "7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186135932 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186135932 #edb/ref 1083 